  "contentHtml": "<p>이미 만들어주신거에 제가 숟가락 얻고 학교 출판사에 맞도록 수정해서 오늘 단원 마무리로 </p><p>도전했습니다. </p><p>생각보다 만족한다는 소감을 보고..너무 기쁘네요~</p><p><br></p><p>김정식 선생님께 무한 감사 드립니다!!</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>아이들 피득백 글 올려봅니다!!</p><p><br></p><p>오늘은 스승의 날... 이 소감이 저를 춤추게 합니다.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9935FC495EBE11A416\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"892\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"892\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"주석 2020-05-15 124818.png\"  id=\"A_9935FC495EBE11A4166CF1\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99AE59495EBE11A419\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"817\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"817\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"주석 2020-05-15 124755.png\"  id=\"A_99AE59495EBE11A419F2C1\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999750495EBE11A513\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"896\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"896\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"주석 2020-05-15 124549.png\"  id=\"A_999750495EBE11A5136FB7\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99557B495EBE11A51B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"895\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"895\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"주석 2020-05-15 124513.png\"  id=\"A_99557B495EBE11A51B04AD\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D326495EBE11A512\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"860\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"860\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"주석 2020-05-15 124355.png\"  id=\"A_99D326495EBE11A512A82D\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
